This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-drowsiness layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-drowsiness layer to your build
 II. Purpose


I. Adding the meta-drowsiness layer to your build
=================================================

Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer meta-drowsiness'


II. Purpose
============

Drowsyness Detection:
  This application detects the driver behaviour and gives the alert in the display.

  Detects drowsiness by tracking eye closure duration, yawning (mouth openness), and head orientation to monitor driver alertness effectively.

